    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/df89bbb5be8047328f2f3cb5c273f0dd.avif?t=1755237687\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > home of the slimes is in danger...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can save them \u2014 by transforming them into mana and unleashing powerful magic!<br>Match slimes strategically to fuel your spells and fight your way through <strong>around 12 intense battles per run</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>tough monsters</strong>, <strong>undead hordes</strong>, <strong>vengeful spirits</strong>, <strong>fallen kings</strong>, and even ancient <strong>calamities</strong>.<br><br>Adapt to every situation with the right spells, the right path... and the right slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/2d0899194059f4d84ac1028cbaaf99e3.poster.avif?t=1755237687\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/2d0899194059f4d84ac1028cbaaf99e3.webm?t=1755237687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/2d0899194059f4d84ac1028cbaaf99e3.mp4?t=1755237687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slime Match Adventure</strong> is a <strong>Match-3 Puzzle Roguelite</strong> where every match fuels your magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine colorful slimes on the board to generate mana and unleash powerful spells from your <strong>Spellbook</strong>.<br>Each spell reacts differently depending on the situation \u2014 will you heal, strike, summon lightning, or break the board?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your path on the <strong>branching combat map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy to each encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your run with new power-ups and upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a series of battles, each more dangerous than the last. <br>Survive long enough, and you may even face the true calamities threatening the slime realm...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/b537c0591cce6df22c13e0b5d58d509e.avif?t=1755237687\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression &amp; Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, you\u2019ll visit the <strong>Shop</strong> \u2014 spend your hard-earned money to unlock new <strong>spells</strong> that expand your combat options and combo potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not all...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter magical <strong>Wishing Panels</strong>. Make a wish and receive powerful <strong>passive stat boosts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run makes you stronger.<br>Every attempt gets you closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover the perfect build and dominate the board?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/996d68012b791344a183511e95ee429f.avif?t=1755237687\" width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/65dc6e84e14ce4160b30c235ead8e8ac.avif?t=1755237687\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Encounters &amp; Dynamic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face <strong>elite monsters</strong> with enhanced health and unique battlefield effects.<br>Some stages will introduce <strong>dynamic lighting</strong> that alters your visibility \u2014 changing the way you approach each move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That spell you thought was useless?<br>In the right moment, it might just save your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>boss</strong> not only brings a gameplay challenge, but also their own <strong>original soundtrack</strong>, woven with lore and subtle clues about their origins and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/710ad0efe127fd067f7334ad60aafd6b.avif?t=1755237687\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/df89bbb5be8047328f2f3cb5c273f0dd.avif?t=1755237687\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > home of the slimes is in danger...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can save them \u2014 by transforming them into mana and unleashing powerful magic!<br>Match slimes strategically to fuel your spells and fight your way through <strong>around 12 intense battles per run</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>tough monsters</strong>, <strong>undead hordes</strong>, <strong>vengeful spirits</strong>, <strong>fallen kings</strong>, and even ancient <strong>calamities</strong>.<br><br>Adapt to every situation with the right spells, the right path... and the right slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/2d0899194059f4d84ac1028cbaaf99e3.poster.avif?t=1755237687\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/2d0899194059f4d84ac1028cbaaf99e3.webm?t=1755237687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/2d0899194059f4d84ac1028cbaaf99e3.mp4?t=1755237687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slime Match Adventure</strong> is a <strong>Match-3 Puzzle Roguelite</strong> where every match fuels your magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine colorful slimes on the board to generate mana and unleash powerful spells from your <strong>Spellbook</strong>.<br>Each spell reacts differently depending on the situation \u2014 will you heal, strike, summon lightning, or break the board?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your path on the <strong>branching combat map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy to each encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your run with new power-ups and upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a series of battles, each more dangerous than the last. <br>Survive long enough, and you may even face the true calamities threatening the slime realm...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/b537c0591cce6df22c13e0b5d58d509e.avif?t=1755237687\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression &amp; Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, you\u2019ll visit the <strong>Shop</strong> \u2014 spend your hard-earned money to unlock new <strong>spells</strong> that expand your combat options and combo potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not all...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter magical <strong>Wishing Panels</strong>. Make a wish and receive powerful <strong>passive stat boosts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run makes you stronger.<br>Every attempt gets you closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover the perfect build and dominate the board?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/996d68012b791344a183511e95ee429f.avif?t=1755237687\" width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/65dc6e84e14ce4160b30c235ead8e8ac.avif?t=1755237687\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Encounters &amp; Dynamic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face <strong>elite monsters</strong> with enhanced health and unique battlefield effects.<br>Some stages will introduce <strong>dynamic lighting</strong> that alters your visibility \u2014 changing the way you approach each move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That spell you thought was useless?<br>In the right moment, it might just save your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>boss</strong> not only brings a gameplay challenge, but also their own <strong>original soundtrack</strong>, woven with lore and subtle clues about their origins and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/710ad0efe127fd067f7334ad60aafd6b.avif?t=1755237687\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
